nough events (6 after 1885's own) to carry the 5 required hops.\n\n**Confounder control.** Volume alone does not explain this: the six chain nodes emit 36 events over the 28 800-unit window (step_15), yet ~9 of them (25%) fall in the 3 000-unit burst (10% of time) that begins at 1885's out-event \u2014 a ~2.4\u00d7 concentration. The overall graph is sparse and near-non-repeating (repeat_ratio 0.0135, step_01), and 1460's in-degree is only 3 (step_05/step_06), so 1460 is not a popularity hub that would be reached by chance.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_08b012b4\",\n  \"decision\": \"present\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1885, 749, 1453, 1871, 632, 1460],\n  \"window\": [22883, 25282],\n  \"confidence\": 0.6,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"Exactly one directed route links 1885 to 1460: 1885\u2192749\u21921453\u21921871\u2192632\u21921460; the alternative 1572\u2192826 branch dead-ends. Fine-grained 600-unit binning of the chain nodes shows that three of 1885's four activity epochs are followed by empty bins (gap >600), killing propagation, but the epoch beginning at ~22883 sits inside an unbroken, unusually dense run of chain-node activity (9 of the group's 36 events in 10% of the window) with enough events to realise all five hops within the 600-unit relay constraint. Given the sparse, low-repeat background and 1460's low in-degree, this concentration is unlikely to be a volume or popularity artefact, so a time-respecting cascade is judged present, though exact per-event timestamps could not be resolved within the tool budget.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 53196, "total_output_tokens": 10400, "total_tokens": 63596, "total_latency_ms": 134966, "llm_calls": 8, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}